2026-10-13T10:21:06.9653756Z   --model MODEL         model directory (or config.json) for model-driven
2026-10-13T10:21:06.9654278Z                         mode. When set, shard-size/shard-number/block-number
2026-10-13T10:21:06.9654671Z                         are computed from the model config and override any
2026-10-13T10:21:06.9655007Z                         manually provided values.
2026-10-13T10:21:06.9655354Z   --tp TP               tensor parallel size; divides num_kv_heads per rank
